WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.134 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How are you?
-I'm good.

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just wore a little headband
for you, darling.

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:04.004 size:81% position:41%
-I love that you wore
your headband tonight.

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:06.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm gonna play tennis later,
so I just thought I...

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:09.309
-But, like, you're gonna play
tennis at night without lights.

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:11.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, sure. Of course.
This is what this is for.

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:14.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yes.
It's my sweatband and light.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:16.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's perfect.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's perfect.
I know very few people

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.653
who could pull it off, and
you are in that small category.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm one of those idiots?
-Yeah.

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:23.023 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.824
-Actually purchased this myself.
Yep.

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:25.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, good!
-Yep.

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:27.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I'm glad. You're owning
up to it and everything.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yep.
-Yeah.

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:32.198
I hope it wasn't at the store
that I was gonna buy mine at.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.900 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, they only had one.
-Oh, no!

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.737
-You're gonna have to go to the
other store that carries these.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:38.471 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-So, I want to ask.

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:41.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
You were in Vancouver,
you did a TED Talk.

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:43.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Which is when I bought this!
But sorry.

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:43.643 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:45.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was my gift
after the TED Talk at Gucci.

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:47.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So for those who don't know,
I mean, were you nervous?

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:51.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
And what is the -- what is the
undertaking of a TED Talk?

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:54.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was terrified.
-Uh-huh.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.288 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-You write a talk.

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:56.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
They don't like
to call it a speech

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:57.857 align:start size:94% position:6%
because it's supposed
to be a relaxed,

00:00:57.857 --> 00:00:59.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
sort of conversational
situation.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:02.495 align:start size:94% position:6%
Little did I know that
you don't have a teleprompter.

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.798
-Okay, so you got it memorized.
-Yes, but I was like,

00:01:04.798 --> 00:01:07.133 align:start size:94% position:6%
"No, I'm gonna hold cards."
-What's the time limit?

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:10.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They like you to be between
9 and like 12 minutes.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-I did 10.

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Nice.
Well, that's right in there.

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:16.743 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is. Check!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:20.914
I remember, when rehearsed it,
it was about nine, so I was --

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:23.716 size:88% position:44%
you know, in the moment,
it got a little longer.

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:24.150 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Good.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was happy with my material
but terrified.

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:29.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
Kept rehearsing it, and
I don't know, and it happened.

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:31.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was honestly
one of the scariest things

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:32.192 line:92%
I've ever done in my life.

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:35.562
I felt like every smarty-pants,
smarty, smarty person

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:37.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
was, like, sitting there,
looking at me like --

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:39.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Scoffs ]
-Yeah,

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:41.167 line:92%
Yeah, you don't get the sense

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:42.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
that dummies
show up to TED Talks.

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:44.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
So I was terrified.

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:46.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. And what was --
What were --

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:48.308
Who were the other people you
met over the course of doing it?

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:51.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, well, first of all,
when you go to TED,

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:53.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
you get invited
into their community,

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:56.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
their TED community,
so you get join the TED app,

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:58.318
which is like a TEDConnect app.
-Okay.

00:01:58.318 --> 00:02:02.255
-And I think it was so you could
create a community there,

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:04.257 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I thought
it was a dating app.

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:06.192
-Okay, got you.
-I've never been on a dating app

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:09.229
but I was like, "Oh, look!
There's a bio and a picture!"

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:10.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like "This guy's cute!
This guy's cute!"

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.066 align:start size:94% position:6%
So my friend
that was with me was like --

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:14.667 size:88% position:44%
she was like, "Let me so
who's in your network,"

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:16.836 size:84% position:42%
and I was like, "Okay."
She was like, "Um...

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:20.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
everyone in your network
is a black man with a beard."

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:20.907 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:24.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "Is that true?
Oh, interesting."

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:28.615
So I was, like, wandering around
at TED, like, thinking,

00:02:28.615 --> 00:02:31.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I bet you he's in my network,
he's in my network.

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:34.521 size:81% position:41%
Bet you that's one of
my guys in my network.

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:35.788 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And then -- okay.

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:38.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, then, I rehearsed,
and the day I was supposed

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:40.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
to do my talk,
like two hours before,

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:41.895
they told me
I was gonna open the conference,

00:02:41.895 --> 00:02:45.532
like, be the first person,
and I was -- excuse my French --

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:46.799 align:start size:94% position:6%
but [bleep] bricks.
-Yeah.

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:48.401 line:92%
-I was a little out of my body.

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:50.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whatever.
But I'm still seeing my --

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:51.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Lot of pressure
to be the opener.

00:02:51.905 --> 00:02:53.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Muh -- Yeah. Uh...
-Yeah.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:54.641 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.641 --> 00:02:55.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I was a little
out of my body,

00:02:55.942 --> 00:02:58.011 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I decided
that maybe I would have

00:02:58.011 --> 00:02:59.045 align:start size:94% position:6%
some of the people
in my network,

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:01.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, some of the other
black folks that were there,

00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:04.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
do a "Wakanda forever"
if I got on stage.

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:06.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Seems like a great idea.

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:07.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:07.954 --> 00:03:10.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So I thought --
I thought it would, like,

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.193
give me a little Wakanda juice.
Do you know what I mean?

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:15.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What is a network for
if not that.

00:03:15.562 --> 00:03:16.429 align:start size:94% position:6%
-If not for that.
-Yeah.

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:19.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So I am walking around, like,
telling people, like,

00:03:19.132 --> 00:03:21.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Listen, I'm first.
I'm a little nervous.

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:22.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
If I go up there
and 'Wakanda forever,'

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:25.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
don't leave me hanging."
They were like, "We got you."

00:03:25.038 --> 00:03:26.206 line:92%
I was like, "Great. You got me."

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:28.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm walking out
to go get myself together,

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:31.244
and I see this bearded man,
and I'm like, "My husband."

00:03:31.244 --> 00:03:31.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Clearly.

00:03:31.945 --> 00:03:34.447
So I'm walking towards him,
I'm like, "Bearded, yeah, yeah."

00:03:34.447 --> 00:03:35.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he's like, "Hey."
I'm like, "Hey."

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:37.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he's like,
"This is my wife."

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.818 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "Not my husband."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.818 --> 00:03:40.320
So he introduces me to his wife,
and then I'm like,

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.689
"Hey, by the way, I'm first up,
I'm a little nervous.

00:03:42.689 --> 00:03:43.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you're in the room,
like, please,

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:47.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, 'Wakanda forever'
with me," and he was like,

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Uh-huh...
Cool, okay."

00:03:49.529 --> 00:03:52.031
Little awkward, but I was like
"Great, nice, nice to meet you."

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:55.134 align:start size:94% position:6%
We go down -- Me and my friend
go down in the escalator,

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:58.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she's like, "Oh, my God."
I'm like, "What?"

00:03:58.004 --> 00:04:01.908
She was like, I cannot believe
that I just met Ryan Coogler,

00:04:01.908 --> 00:04:03.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
the director
of 'Black Panther.'"

00:04:03.376 --> 00:04:07.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "Where was he?!"
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:07.647 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Where was he?!"

00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:09.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
She was like,
"What are you talking about?"

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:13.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's who you just
asked to 'Wakanda forever.'"

00:04:13.653 --> 00:04:14.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Gasps ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:18.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "Oh, my God!
I am such an idiot!"

00:04:18.658 --> 00:04:21.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so we tried
to go back up to find him,

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:23.563 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he had, like,
disappeared into Wakanda.

00:04:23.563 --> 00:04:24.097 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He was gone.

00:04:24.097 --> 00:04:27.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was, like, "Clearly, I'm not
gonna be in 'Wakanda 2.'"

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:31.704
But, yeah, so anyway, I asked
the director of "Black Panther"

00:04:31.704 --> 00:04:33.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
to 'Wakanda forever.'
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.539 --> 00:04:36.009 size:84% position:42%
-It would've been great
if he had said to you,

00:04:36.009 --> 00:04:37.210 line:92%
"And if I'm having trouble,

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.511 align:start size:94% position:6%
if you could just
go 'Black-ish.'"

00:04:38.511 --> 00:04:40.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
He didn't say that.

00:04:40.179 --> 00:04:43.983 size:75% position:38%
He was just, like --
[ Laughs nervously ]

00:04:43.983 --> 00:04:44.684 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:04:44.684 --> 00:04:48.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
Foot in mouth!
So embarrassing!

